<li><strong>Google fined €403 million over location-data processing</strong> Ireland’s Data Protection Commission fined Google €403 million after an inquiry into its processing of location data. <em>21 Sep 2026.</em> <a href="https://www.reuters.com/business/media-telecom/irish-regulator-fines-google-403-million-over-location-data-processing-2026-09-21/">Reuters</a> · <a href="intent://chatgpt.com/new?q=I%20read%20the%20following%20article%3A%20%22Google%20fined%20%E2%82%AC403%20million%20over%20location-data%20processing.%20Ireland%E2%80%99s%20Data%20Protection%20Commission%20fined%20Google%20%E2%82%AC403%20million%20after%20an%20inquiry%20into%20its%20processing%20of%20location%20data.%22.%20I%20have%20a%20question%3A%20#Intent;scheme=https;package=app.vanadium.browser;end">Follow up</a></li>
