<li><strong>Australian wholesale power prices fall sharply</strong> Wholesale electricity prices in Australia fell 21% to 43% year-on-year across states in the September quarter, reducing the wholesale component feeding future retail electricity costs. <em>21 Sep 2026.</em> <a href="https://www.theaustralian.com.au/business/renewable-energy-economy/power-price-plunge-creates-dilemma-for-labors-energy-transition/news-story/d77811e44592dd19573668ce8ecfe46c">The Australian</a> · <a href="intent://chatgpt.com/new?q=I%20read%20the%20following%20article%3A%20%22Australian%20wholesale%20power%20prices%20fall%20sharply.%20Wholesale%20electricity%20prices%20in%20Australia%20fell%2021%25%20to%2043%25%20year-on-year%20across%20states%20in%20the%20September%20quarter%2C%20reducing%20the%20wholesale%20component%20feeding%20future%20retail%20electricity%20costs.%22.%20I%20have%20a%20question%3A%20#Intent;scheme=https;package=app.vanadium.browser;end">Follow up</a></li>
